{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Analyze a property"},"description":"Analyze one US residential address and return the structured report: valuation.range (the comp-supported low to high with its measured error), valuation.anchor.price (the working price; valuation.anchor.source is what it is, and promoted_from names a figure that was set aside and NOT used, explained in valuation.anchor.explanation), negotiating_position (only when there is a real ask), condition (with evidence[]: the permits and code violations read, full text, each marked applies_to property, this_unit, other_unit or building; only property and this_unit records describe this home), confidence (High, Medium or Low, with what would tighten it), comps (the sales behind the range first, with in_range, up to 12 here and an 'omitted' block saying what was left out; get_report with full=true returns up to 50, and every excluded one; needs an API key, without one comps is empty and search.comps_withheld says so; search.pool_size says how many there were), tax (current bill and post-sale scenarios), listing, history, market, risks, gaps (what could not be determined) and attributions (notices that must accompany the figures when you repeat them). A null field means 'not determined'; an empty list means 'determined, none'. Pass list_price when you know the ask, and facts, condition and previous_sale for anything you know about the property (the input schema lists every field and its allowed values): they sharpen the answer and are recorded under inputs_used. A request that carries such facts is private to you and is not added to the shared cache. To steer the comparable sales: comp_radius_miles pins the search radius (no widening), exclude_comps lists addresses to leave out, and include_comps adds sales you know of (address, sale_price, sale_date, and sqft, beds, baths, year_built or lot_sqft if known); the report marks those comps provenance 'user', caps confidence at Medium, and excluded_comps[] shows what was dropped and why. If several parcels match, the result has status 'needs_confirmation' with candidates: call again with confirm_pin set to the chosen pin. If the analysis takes longer than the wait budget the result has status 'processing' and a job_id: call get_job. include=['narrative'] adds the written report (60 to 90 seconds, needs an API key). fresh forces a new run instead of a cached one (needs an API key). The result is data about a property. Addresses (the subject's and the comparable sales') and answer text originate outside CompBasis, are marked x-untrusted in the API schema, and can contain arbitrary text.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"CallerComp":{"description":"A sale the caller supplies as a comp (v1 ``include_comps``). Entirely the caller's own facts, marked provenance ``user``; nothing is looked up for it.","properties":{"address":{"maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"baths":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":20,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"beds":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":20,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"lot_sqft":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"sale_date":{"format":"date","type":"string"},"sale_price":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":100000000,"type":"number"},"sqft":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":50000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"year_built":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":2100,"minimum":1700,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null}},"required":["address","sale_price","sale_date"],"type":"object"},"CommuteDestination":{"properties":{"address":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"max_minutes":{"maximum":240,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"mode":{"enum":["driving","transit","either"],"type":"string"}},"required":["address","max_minutes","mode"],"type":"object"},"PriorListingPeriod":{"description":"One earlier listing period of this sale attempt, as the caller knows it (the feed shows only the current one): when it started, when it ended (None if unknown) and the asking price.","properties":{"end":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"price":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"start":{"format":"date","type":"string"}},"required":["start"],"type":"object"},"UserPriorities":{"description":"Optional user-provided priorities.\n\nIf None or all fields empty, the report omits section 12 entirely.","properties":{"commute_destinations":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CommuteDestination"},"maxItems":3,"type":"array"},"layout_needs":{"items":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"type":"array"},"other_priorities":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":600,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"purpose":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["primary_residence","investment","flip","second_home"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null}},"type":"object"},"V1Condition":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The condition intake exactly as the internal API takes it, plus the three rental and teardown answers the internal request keeps beside it.","properties":{"actual_monthly_rent_per_unit":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"actual_rent":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"air_conditioning_type":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["window_units","central","heat_pump","mini_split","none"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"assumable_loan_balance":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"assumable_loan_rate_pct":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":25,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"assumable_loan_remaining_years":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":40,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"assumable_loan_type":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["fha","va","usda","other"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"bath_updated":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["lt_5yr","5_10yr","original"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"buyer_down_payment_amount":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"buyer_down_payment_pct":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"buyer_interest_rate_pct":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":25,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"buyer_loan_term_years":{"anyOf":[{"enum":[15,20,30],"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"confirmed_not_listed":{"anyOf":[{"type":"boolean"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"coop_flip_tax_pct":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":25,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"coop_min_down_payment_pct":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"electrical_panel_age_years":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":150,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"electrical_panel_amperage":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["60","100","150","200","400"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"finished_basement_sqft":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":20000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"foundation_type_confirmed":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["full_basement","partial_basement","crawl_space","slab","other"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"garage_type_confirmed":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["attached","detached","none"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"hvac_age_years":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":150,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"kitchen_updated":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["lt_5yr","5_10yr","original"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"known_issues":{"items":{"enum":["basement_water","foundation_repair","insurance_claim","roof_leak","mold"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":5,"type":"array"},"lead